<AlienRace.ThingDef_AlienRace ParentName="BasePawn">
        <defName>NephilaHandmaiden</defName>
        <label>nephila handmaiden</label>
        <description>A Nephila Handmaiden. These swollen goo girls are an evolved form of the standard nephila. Born from the infusion of a standard nephilim's core in one of the "beloved one" hosts that the nephila use to reproduce, handmaidens are more intelligent and well rounded than the standard maidens below them. Their exaggerated pulchritude is a result of increased fecundity and they tend to produce larger litters of cherubim. Their pulchritude slows them down even further than a traditional maiden, however.</description>
